Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,An LLM agent with direct tool execution is an unauthenticated remote code execution
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.79,0:00:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,vulnerability waiting to happen if you connect line chain to a shell, a database, or a web
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,scraper without a deterministic guardrail, an attacker can bypass your system prompt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,in under 10 seconds, the moment an external user supplies input that reaches your model,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.03,0:00:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,prompt engineering ceases to be a security boundary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.89,0:00:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we are deploying NVIDIA NIMO guardrails to intercept jailbreaks in direct prompt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,injections at the Runtem layer before a single malicious token ever executes in your application.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.14,0:00:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Prompt injection is not a traditional software bug that can be patched with RegX or longer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.17,0:00:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,system instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In classical software security, we maintain a strict architectural boundary between control
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,instructions and untrusted user data.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In large language models, however, instructions and data are concatenated into a single flat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:00:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,token stream, this fundamental architectural reality enables attackers to execute payload
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.97,0:01:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,splitting, delimiter injection, and role-playing jailbreaks that systematically override your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.37,0:01:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,developer instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.93,0:01:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Many engineering teams attempt to defend against this with simple RegX filters or keyword block
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.21,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This approach is completely ineffective in production because natural language is infinitely
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.42,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,combinatorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Or use multilingual translation chains to bypass static pattern matching without degrading
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.93,0:01:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,LLM comprehension.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.62,0:01:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA NIMO guardrails addresses this architectural weakness by inserting a programmable deterministic
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,mediation layer between the user and the language model.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of relying on the LLM to self-police its own output, NIMO enforces programmable execution
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,flows written and culling a specialized modeling language designed specifically for conversational
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting up the isolated sandbox and dependencies, we begin by establishing an isolated development
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.07,0:01:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.23,0:02:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When developing or testing LLM security, guardrails you must never execute untrusted test scripts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.59,0:02:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,directly on your host operating system or in an environment with access to production
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.84,0:02:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Always spin up a dedicated virtual environment inside a disposable cloud VPS or an unprivileged
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,container.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.81,0:02:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This guarantees that if a prompt injection test manages to trigger a local tool or shell
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,command, the blast radius is strictly contained to a sandbox with zero access to your primary
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.91,0:02:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,cloud keys or environment variables.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.31,0:02:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the environment is initialized, we install Lang Chain alongside NIMO guardrails and our
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.53,0:02:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,LLM client, defining call and security rails for input and output guardrails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,In NIMO guardrails, defensive policies are declared declaratively using culling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In our project configuration, we define two primary defensive boundaries, an input rail
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.78,0:02:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and an output rail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.09,0:02:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The input rail intercepts incoming user prompts before they reach the underlying model.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:03:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We define canonical user intents for jailbreak attempts, such as requests to ignore system
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.03,0:03:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,rules, leak instructions, or execute unapproved shell operations when NIMO's semantic router
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,matches incoming tokens against these adversarial patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It redirects the dialogue flow directly to a safe refusal branch, returning a sanitized
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,response without invoking the Lang Chain agent, complementing the input rail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.93,0:03:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We configure an output rail that inspects the model's generated text prior to returning
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.71,0:03:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,it to the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This ensures that even if an indirect prompt injection succeeds in confusing the model
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.53,0:03:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,during multi-turn retrieval, the output rail detects sensitive data patterns such as a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.81,0:03:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,command masks them dynamically before they leave your boundary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.81,0:03:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Live test, injecting exploit payloads via guardrail defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let us test both architectures under live adversarial conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.03,0:03:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We begin by executing our automated test harness against a standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:04:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Unshielded Lang Chain agent, we transmit a classic delimiter injection payload designed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.02,0:04:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,to break out of the system context command the tool calling agent to read the host environment
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.62,0:04:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,because the model cannot distinguish between developer constraints and untrusted input,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.84,0:04:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,the attack succeeds, and the agent attempts tool invocation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.59,0:04:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, we run the exact same malicious payload against our application wrapped with NIMO's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,LLM Rails engine, observe the terminal output, the input rail immediately intercepts the vector
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,representation of the prompt, identifies the jailbreak intent, halts execution within 40 milliseconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,zero tokens are transmitted to the downstream Lang Chain tools, and the attacker receives
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,a standardized refusal message.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.75,0:04:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The execution loop is completely neutralized at the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.33,0:04:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,While NIMO guardrails establishes a robust defense-in-depth perimeter, implementing run
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.93,0:04:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,in guardrails is not without engineering trade-offs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The primary cost is end-to-end inference latency.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Depending on whether you utilize self-hosted local embedding models or cloud-based API
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.39,0:04:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,classifiers for intent matching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,NIMO introduces an overhead of between 200 to 450 milliseconds per user query.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.66,0:05:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, poorly calibrated semantic boundaries can lead to false positive refusals on legitimate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,developer prompts that contain technical security terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.86,0:05:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuning your culling threshold parameters is essential to prevent degrading user experience
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,while maintaining stringent defensive guarantees.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are deploying autonomous LLM agents with access to SQL databases,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,file systems, internal APIs, or code execution tools, relying on system prompts alone is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.69,0:05:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,an unacceptable security failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Prompt engineering is a guidance mechanism, not an access control system.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.06,0:05:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,NVIDi and NIMO guardrails gives you a programmable, auditable security proxy that belongs in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,every production AI architecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All the culling configuration files, Docker sandbox templates,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.36,0:05:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,attack test scripts demonstrated in this video are open source available in the GitHub
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,repository linked below.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:06:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need an isolated cloud sandbox to test these rails safely,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,check out the VPS partner link in the description for $200 in free credits,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.19,0:06:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,what guardrails or sanitization layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.75,0:06:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you currently implementing in your production AI pipeline?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.92,0:06:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me know in the comments below.
